2,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is lovely to see you all. Since we are growing, perhaps we can find a layout that helps us talk to one another more naturally? I want us to feel close and connected.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Connection is important, but we should also consider the practicalities of the space. If we change the layout, we need to be clear about how the seats are allocated so no one feels slighted.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with both of you. But, um, I'm a bit worried about the cost. If we change things too much, will it be too expensive for the team?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to make the place feel fresh! But we should make sure the new layout doesn't make our mornings more hectic. I don't want us wasting precious time just getting settled in!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get carried away with ""feelings"" and ""freshness"" just yet. If we're moving, we need to ensure the actual experience of sitting there for eight hours is sustainable. Comfort isn't a luxury; it's a requirement.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"You all make such wonderful points. To make sure we are being thoughtful, perhaps we should look into the costs Daisuke mentioned and how our current seating affects our daily interactions?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. I also think we should examine the badge records and the staff survey. It would be useful to see the actual patterns of arrival and how people currently feel about their positions.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, if it's okay... I'd like to know more about the floor billing. And maybe the facilities quote for the power and network? I just want to be sure we can afford it.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, that's a great idea! I'm curious about the badge records too. Also, I want to know about the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs to see if they've found a way to stay efficient!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your frugality is touching, but a cheap layout that kills our backs is a waste of money. I'll look into the sound meter readings and the physio's note from the workstation check.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a good list starting. I would like to look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and the two project strands within earshot last spring to see how we interact.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have a general sense of the priorities, I will stick with my suggestion. I'll look into the arrival times in the badge records and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... stick with the ones I mentioned. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. I just don't want us to overspend.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll go with the arrival times in the badge records and the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs! I really want to see how we can start our days without any stress!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll stick to my guns. I'm looking into the sound meter readings and the physio's note. Let's see if the data supports the need for actual comfort over mere aesthetics.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a wonderful plan. We are covering everything from our budgets to our well-being. I look forward to seeing what we discover so we can create a happy space for everyone.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Let's ensure we remain objective when reviewing the data. It is easy to overlook the less desirable aspects of a layout, but we must be honest about the trade-offs involved in our final decision.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the information helps us make a safe choice. I'll do my best to find the details on the costs so we don't run into any trouble later.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm so ready for this! I'll dig into those records and the pilot floor's routine. Let's find a way to make our mornings super smooth and energetic! See you all soon!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Try not to let your enthusiasm blind you to the physics of the room, Mio. I'll be the one bringing the reality check regarding our physical health. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
